{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "授权书",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 84.36,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "账户抽象，是让合约代码来决定，账户怎么验证、怎么执行。",
   "spoken": "账户抽象，是让合约代码来决定，账户怎么验证、怎么执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.1,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 3.199,
   "speechEnd": 8.451
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "协议不再写死，一把私钥签一笔交易。",
   "spoken": "协议不再写死，一把私钥签一笔交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 8.92,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 8.92,
   "speechEnd": 12.533
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "打个比方。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 12.98,
   "dur": 0.8,
   "speechStart": 13.08,
   "speechEnd": 13.568
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "以前去银行，每笔转账都要本人签字。",
   "spoken": "以前去银航，每笔转账都要本人签字。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 14.0,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 14.092,
   "speechEnd": 17.441
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "现在你可以签一份授权书，允许助理每天替你付 100 元以内的账单。",
   "spoken": "现在你可以签一份授权书，允许助理每天替你付 100 元以内的账单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 17.9,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 17.9,
   "speechEnd": 23.489
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "授权书让生活方便很多。",
   "spoken": "授权书让生活方便很多。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 23.96,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 24.056,
   "speechEnd": 25.896
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "可如果签的是，允许持有人处理我全部财产，后果比签错一笔转账严重得多。",
   "spoken": "可如果签的是，允许持有人楚理我全部财产，后果比签错一笔转账严重得多。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 26.34,
   "dur": 7.68,
   "speechStart": 26.34,
   "speechEnd": 33.834
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "比喻不成立的地方是，纸质授权书要公证，也能去银行撤销。",
   "spoken": "比喻不成立的地方是，纸质授权书要公证，也能去银航撤销。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 34.24,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 34.342,
   "speechEnd": 39.391
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "链上的委托签名立刻生效，有时在多条链上同时生效。",
   "spoken": "链上的委托签名立刻生效，有时在多条链上同时生效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 39.82,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 39.917,
   "speechEnd": 44.334
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "新流程里有哪些角色？先看 ERC-4337。",
   "spoken": "新流程里有哪些决色？先看 ERC-4337。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 44.76,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 44.76,
   "speechEnd": 49.168
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "用户不直接发交易，而是提交一个用户操作，UserOperation。",
   "spoken": "用户不直接发交易，而是提交一个用户操作，UserOperation。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 49.62,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 49.62,
   "speechEnd": 54.3
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "Bundler 是打包者，把很多个用户操作，打包成一笔链上交易。",
   "spoken": "Bundler 是打包者，把很多个用户操作，打包成一笔链上交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 54.72,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 54.828,
   "speechEnd": 59.601
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "EntryPoint 是统一的入口合约，它先验证，再执行。",
   "spoken": "EntryPoint 是统一的入口合约，它先验证，再执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 60.06,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 60.166,
   "speechEnd": 64.636
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "第一步，问智能账户，签名对不对。",
   "spoken": "第一步，问智能账户，签名对不对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 65.08,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 65.181,
   "speechEnd": 68.309
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "第二步，问 Paymaster，愿不愿意替用户付 Gas。",
   "spoken": "第二步，问 Paymaster，愿不愿意替用户付 Gas。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 68.74,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 68.832,
   "speechEnd": 72.454
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "两步都通过，才执行用户要做的调用，最后结算 Gas。",
   "spoken": "两步都通过，才执行用户要做的掉用，最后结算 Gas。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 72.88,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 72.973,
   "speechEnd": 77.397
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "验证和执行，被拆成了两步。",
   "spoken": "验证和执行，被拆成了两步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 77.82,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 77.82,
   "speechEnd": 80.47
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "每一步的边界，都可能出错。",
   "spoken": "每一步的边界，都可能出错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep15/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 80.92,
   "dur": 2.24,
   "speechStart": 81.013,
   "speechEnd": 82.973
  }
